{"unit_id":"Flyvhidbwo__dsh-vision-proxy#card-zh","repo":"Flyvhidbwo/dsh-vision-proxy","commit":"fa865231b3ad87add1e66038faadfb5ef9115788","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-vision-proxy 为 DeepSeek Harness 增加 deepseek-vision 路由，把附加图片交给官方 DeepSeek 或自定义 OpenAI 兼容视觉模型转成 OCR 与图像描述，再由原 DeepSeek 适配器回答。它支持多模型降级、本机 Ollama、原生视觉直通和设置页配置，适合希望用纯文本 DeepSeek 处理图片的用户。默认复用 DEEPSEEK_API_KEY；也可配置自定义端点或本机模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:759-984","lib/index.js:181-186","lib/client.js:1-10","lib/index.js:324-336"]}
